<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-CN">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1.0,maximum-scale=1.0,user-scalable=no">
<title>剁椒酱 · 沧林食品</title>
<style>
*{margin:0;padding:0;box-sizing:border-box}
body{font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,"PingFang SC","Microsoft YaHei",sans-serif;background:#f0e9e2;color:#2c2c2c;padding:24px 16px;line-height:1.7}
.card{max-width:540px;margin:0 auto;background:#faf8f5;border-radius:18px;overflow:hidden;box-shadow:0 2px 20px rgba(0,0,0,.05)}
.meta{padding:20px 22px 14px;background:#fdf8f0;border-bottom:1px solid #eee5d8}
.meta .badge{display:inline-block;font-size:10px;font-weight:700;color:#C0392B;background:#fef2ee;padding:2px 10px;border-radius:4px;margin-bottom:6px}
.meta h1{font-size:20px;font-weight:700;color:#3a322a;line-height:1.3;margin-bottom:2px}
.meta .sub{font-size:12px;color:#b5aaa0;margin-bottom:10px}
.meta .tags{display:flex;gap:4px;flex-wrap:wrap}
.meta .tags span{font-size:10px;padding:2px 10px;background:#f5ede5;border-radius:12px;color:#5a4f44}
.level-banner{display:flex;gap:8px;padding:10px 22px;background:#fef9f2;border-bottom:1px solid #eee5d8;flex-wrap:wrap}
.level-item{font-size:11px;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:6px;background:#f0e9e2;color:#5a4f44}
.level-item.high{background:#C0392B;color:#fff}
.section{padding:14px 22px;border-bottom:1px solid #eee5d8}
.s-title{font-size:14px;font-weight:700;color:#3a322a;margin-bottom:10px;padding-bottom:4px;border-bottom:2px solid #f0ece6}
.story{font-size:13px;line-height:2;color:#5a4f44}
.story em{color:#C0392B;font-style:normal;font-weight:600}
.cost-box{padding:12px 14px;background:#f8f4ef;border-radius:10px;margin-bottom:8px}
.row{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;font-size:13px;padding:4px 0;color:#3a322a}
.row .v{font-weight:600}
.row.tot{border-top:1px solid #ddd4ca;margin-top:4px;padding-top:8px;font-weight:700;color:#C0392B}
.talk{padding:10px 14px;background:#fef9f2;border-radius:10px;margin:6px 0;font-size:13px;color:#5a4f44;line-height:1.8}
.alert{font-size:11px;color:#b5aaa0;padding:6px 0 0 0;font-style:italic}
.tip-item{padding:8px 12px;background:#fef9f2;border-left:3px solid #C0392B;border-radius:4px;margin:6px 0;font-size:13px;color:#5a4f44;line-height:1.6}
.ing-table{width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;font-size:12px;margin-top:6px}
.ing-table th{text-align:left;padding:6px 4px;border-bottom:1px solid #ddd4ca;color:#3a322a;font-weight:600;font-size:11px}
.ing-table td{padding:5px 4px;border-bottom:1px solid #f5f0ea;color:#5a4f44}
.ing-table .cat{font-weight:600;color:#3a322a;background:#f8f4ef}
.paywall{padding:24px 22px;text-align:center;background:#fdf8f0}
.paywall .price{font-size:28px;font-weight:800;color:#C0392B}
.paywall .desc{font-size:13px;color:#7a7269;margin:8px 0 16px;line-height:1.6}
.paywall .btn{display:inline-block;background:#C0392B;color:#fff;padding:10px 32px;border-radius:8px;font-size:14px;font-weight:600;text-decoration:none;transition:.2s}
.paywall .btn:hover{background:#a33025}
.paywall .up{font-size:10px;color:#b5aaa0;margin-top:10px}
.free-badge{display:inline-block;font-size:10px;background:#27ae60;color:#fff;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:3px;margin-right:4px}
.lock-badge{display:inline-block;font-size:10px;background:#C0392B;color:#fff;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:3px;margin-right:4px}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="card">
<div class="meta">
  <div class="badge">咔库秘制 · ¥39</div>
  <h1>剁椒酱</h1>
  <div class="sub">泡二荆条打底 · 蒜香浓郁 · 酸辣鲜香</div>
  <div class="tags"><span>#剁椒酱</span><span>#商用配方</span><span>#酸辣</span><span>#万能酱</span></div>
</div>
<div class="level-banner">
  <span class="level-item high">🔥 酱料配方</span>
  <span class="level-item">一批出≈18.5斤</span>
  <span class="level-item">每斤成本≈¥8-14</span>
</div>

<div class="section">
  <div class="s-title"><span class="free-badge">免费</span> 📖 产品说</div>
  <div class="story">
    剁椒酱，湘菜灵魂——蒸鱼头、拌面、蘸饺子、炒菜都行。<br><br>
    泡二荆条+泡小米辣双泡椒打底，蒜末200g爆香，黄灯笼辣椒酱增辣、酸辣鲜露提酸。洋葱泡姜去腥增香，秘制红油收尾。炒出来蒜香浓郁、酸辣鲜香，万能百搭。<br><br>
    一批出约18.5斤酱，每斤成本¥8-14，售价¥18-28/斤。适合做调味酱、拌面酱、蘸料。
  </div>
</div>

<div class="section">
  <div class="s-title"><span class="free-badge">免费</span> 📋 原料清单</div>
  <table class="ing-table">
    <tr><th>类别</th><th>原料</th><th style="text-align:right">用量</th><th style="text-align:right">批量</th></tr>
    <tr><td class="cat" rowspan="3">油脂</td><td>大豆油</td><td style="text-align:right">120g</td><td style="text-align:right">2,400g（2.4kg）</td></tr>
    <tr><td>秘制红油</td><td style="text-align:right">60g</td><td style="text-align:right">1,200g（1.2kg）</td></tr>
    <tr><td>芝麻香油</td><td style="text-align:right">10g</td><td style="text-align:right">200g</td></tr>
    <tr><td class="cat" rowspan="2">炸香</td><td>大蒜末</td><td style="text-align:right">200g</td><td style="text-align:right">4,000g（4kg）</td></tr>
    <tr><td>洋葱末</td><td style="text-align:right">30g</td><td style="text-align:right">600g</td></tr>
    <tr><td class="cat" rowspan="3">泡椒</td><td>泡二荆条末</td><td style="text-align:right">200g</td><td style="text-align:right">4,000g（4kg）</td></tr>
    <tr><td>泡小米辣末</td><td style="text-align:right">25g</td><td style="text-align:right">500g</td></tr>
    <tr><td>泡姜末</td><td style="text-align:right">50g</td><td style="text-align:right">1,000g（1kg）</td></tr>
    <tr><td class="cat" rowspan="2">鲜椒</td><td>青线椒</td><td style="text-align:right">100g</td><td style="text-align:right">2,000g（2kg）</td></tr>
    <tr><td>湘君府黄灯笼辣椒酱</td><td style="text-align:right">40g</td><td style="text-align:right">800g</td></tr>
    <tr><td class="cat" rowspan="5">调味</td><td>家乐酸辣鲜露</td><td style="text-align:right">35g</td><td style="text-align:right">700g</td></tr>
    <tr><td>蚝油</td><td style="text-align:right">60g</td><td style="text-align:right">1,200g（1.2kg）</td></tr>
    <tr><td>白糖</td><td style="text-align:right">80g</td><td style="text-align:right">1,600g（1.6kg）</td></tr>
    <tr><td>鸡精</td><td style="text-align:right">10g</td><td style="text-align:right">200g</td></tr>
    <tr><td>太太乐鲜味宝</td><td style="text-align:right">10g</td><td style="text-align:right">200g</td></tr>
  </table>

</div>

<div class="section">
  <div class="s-title"><span class="free-badge">免费</span> 💰 成本参考</div>
  <div class="cost-box">
    <div class="row"><span>一批总成本</span><span class="v">约¥150-260</span></div>
    <div class="row"><span>出成品酱</span><span class="v">约18.5斤</span></div>
    <div class="row"><span>每斤成本</span><span class="v">约¥8-14</span></div>
    <div class="row"><span>建议售价</span><span class="v">¥18-28/斤</span></div>
    <div class="row tot"><span>一批毛利</span><span class="v">≈¥185-370</span></div>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="section">
  <div class="s-title"><span class="free-badge">免费</span> 🔧 做法</div>
  <div class="launch" style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:8px;font-size:13px;color:#5a4f44;line-height:1.8">
    <span><strong>① 炸香（5min）</strong></span>
    <span>大豆油烧至三成热（约90℃），下洋葱末炸出香味，下泡姜末略微炒制。</span>
    <br>
    <span><strong>② 炒蒜（3min）</strong></span>
    <span>下大蒜末炒出香味。注意：大蒜不要炒干，炒到蒜香出来、表面微黄即可。炒干了发苦。</span>
    <br>
    <span><strong>③ 炒泡椒（1min）</strong></span>
    <span>下泡二荆条末、青线椒、泡小米辣、黄灯笼辣椒酱，炒1min。泡椒水分炒出来一部分即可。</span>
    <br>
    <span><strong>④ 调味关火</strong></span>
    <span>关小火，下酸辣鲜露、白糖、香油、蚝油、鸡精、鲜味宝、秘制红油，搅拌均匀即可关火。小火拌匀，不要让调味料高温挥发。</span>
    <br>
    <span><strong>⑤ 晾凉装瓶</strong></span>
    <span>自然晾凉后装瓶冷藏保存。冷藏可放1-2个月。</span>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="section">
  <div class="s-title"><span class="free-badge">免费</span> 🚫 避坑</div>
  <div class="tip-item">⚠️ 大蒜不能炒干——炒到蒜香出来、表面微黄即可。炒干了发苦，整锅酱味道就偏了。</div>
  <div class="tip-item">⚠️ 调味料关小火再下——酸辣鲜露、鲜味宝这些高温下容易挥发，关小火后拌匀就行。</div>
  <div class="tip-item">⚠️ 泡椒本身有咸味——不需要额外加盐，泡椒和黄灯笼酱的盐度就够了。加盐会过咸。</div>
  <div class="tip-item">⚠️ 青线椒最后放——放太早炒烂了失去鲜椒的清香味。和泡椒一起下，炒1min刚好断生。</div>
</div>


</div>
</body>
</html>
